cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below, along with the
  source publication.
type: software
title: proteoform-regions
authors:
  - family-names: Saadat
    given-names: Shoaib
identifiers:
  - type: url
    value: "https://github.com/ShoabSaadat/proteoform-regions"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ShoabSaadat/proteoform-regions"
abstract: >-
  Proteoform-aware region inference and detection-bias quantification from
  bottom-up proteomics peptide tables. Harmonizes heterogeneous search-engine
  peptide tables into a tiered evidence schema, computes pI/MW physicochemistry,
  stitches detected regions, and quantifies acidic/basic detection bias against
  digestion-matched tryptic backgrounds.
keywords:
  - proteomics
  - proteoform
  - bottom-up
  - isoelectric point
  - detection bias
license: MIT
